notes.content:
Now the game has map number 5 - The Forest!🌲
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42289375/8bd1179f70cc2e38e65a8c462d0c2a630a803f91.png[/img]
[b]Features:[/b]
[list]
[*] The map has 8 defense towers 🗼;
[*] Enemies are more powerful 💪;
[*] The car heads in another direction 🚗;
[/list]

Bugs were also fixed 🐞✔️.

Thanks!

The respective button art for Xbox, PlayStation and Nintendo Switch controllers is now displayed.

You can upgrade the fusion bomb to level 2. It has:
[list]
[*] +15 damage;
[*] + 5 range;
[*] 2 seconds faster to explode again.;
[*] $6000.
[/list]

[list]
[*] Now you can make vehicles more resistant. All impact received by them can be reduced by up to 90% when armor is at maximum level;
[*] There has been modification in the 'Power up' window to add more items;
[*] Fixed some bugs in map 3.
[/list]

[olist]
[*] Vehicle does not stop when touching the rear;
[*] Game freezes only 1 time informing to collect the coins;
[*] Game freezes only 1 time informing about how many cars can explode;
[*] The ax is now tuned!
[/olist]

More updates soon!
Have an idea about what you can improve? Tell me in the Steam community!
